aaa new-model
!
aaa authentication login default local
{# Console is the break-glass path on a virtual node. `aaa new-model` applies the
   default login method to line con 0, which turns an open CML console into one
   demanding local credentials. Keep an explicit console method list so console
   access survives a bad local-user state. #}
aaa authentication login CONSOLE none
aaa authorization exec default local
!
aaa session-id common
!
